window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>Rina accepts an invite to Aikensthorpe, a country-house hotel with a sinister past. Her fellow guests are an eccentric bunch of magicians and scholars who want to re-enact a séance. Back in 1872, it left one man dead and another mad.</p> <p>But Rina won’t be drawn into all of that. She's relieved when Detective MacGregor comes to her rescue.</p> <p>But then a blizzard sets in...leaving them trapped in the house, cut off from civilization. And then the first of the bodies is found—a distinguished scholar, smothered in his sleep.</p> <p>Who will be next to die on this dark and stormy night?</p>"; 
